{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04320","headline":"巫山高 · 乔知之","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山十二峰，参差互隐见。\n浔阳几千里，周览忽已徧。\n想像神女姿，摘芳共珍荐。\n楚云何逶迤，红树日葱蒨。\n楚云没湘源，红树断荆门。\n郢路不可见，况复夜闻猨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}